            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# iSnapNuke 1.0.1

## English

- Updated the English documentation for viewing and safely deleting APFS snapshots.
- Added English screenshots covering the snapshot list, deletion confirmation, and successful deletion.

## 繁體中文

- 更新繁體中文文件，說明如何檢視及安全刪除 APFS 快照。
- 新增繁體中文螢幕截圖，涵蓋快照列表、刪除確認及成功刪除畫面。
]]></description>
